Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.55,0:00:24.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,As long as there are people\Nwho seek freedom in this life,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.03,0:00:27.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,these things shall not\Nvanish from the earth.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.73,0:00:37.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,People tell me my head's in the clouds.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.61,0:00:40.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't care what they say\Nbecause I'm dreaming of you!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.97,0:00:43.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You are the treasure I found.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.65,0:00:46.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So bright, so bold, it's so elusive?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.75,0:00:48.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's hard to look away.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.83,0:00:51.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Even though it's blinding me!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.93,0:00:55.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There are no words to\Ndescribe how I feel inside.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.75,0:00:58.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm really, really stuck on you!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.23,0:01:02.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I have to follow my dreams,\Nhowever crazy they seem.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.63,0:01:05.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And I won't stop till I\Nget there, you will see!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.69,0:01:08.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're all I need to have\Nthe strength to believe.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.97,0:01:12.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Believe in what I do!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.89,0:01:21.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm gonna follow my dreams,\Nhowever crazy they seem.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.21,0:01:24.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm gonna share them\Nwith you, a love so true.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.25,0:01:27.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're all I want,\Ntogether we can move on.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.65,0:01:29.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We live how we want to.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.01,0:01:32.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There is no limit to us!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.13,0:01:33.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We have the power of love.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.65,0:01:36.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We don't want to live ordinary lives.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.73,0:01:39.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We have a chance to live in paradise.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.79,0:01:42.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We live in one another.
Dialogue: 1,0:01:49.98,0:01:56.32,Title-207-,,0,0,0,,{\bord2.2\c&H161617&\3c&H161617&\1a&HFF&\blur0.6\fad(692,0)\fsp-2\t(647,692,\1a&H00&)}The Leaders
Dialogue: 2,0:01:49.98,0:01:56.32,Title-207-,,0,0,0,,{\bord0\c&HE7E7E7&\4a&HFF&\blur0.6\fad(692,0)\fsp-2}The Leaders
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.75,0:01:54.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Move it! Get out of our way! Step aside!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.85,0:01:56.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, isn't that...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.47,0:02:05.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, Chaka, please wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.53,0:02:09.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So who are they?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.29,0:02:11.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The Guardians.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.89,0:02:13.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The Kicking Claw Force.
Dialogue: 1,0:02:16.01,0:02:20.14,Captions-207-,,0,0,0,,{\pos(720,751)\fscx75\fscy75\fnDFPGiHi-W7-Strp\b0\c&H201E1E&\3c&H201E1E&\blur1\fad(521,0)\bord3.5\1a&HFF&\t(0,521,\1a&H00&)}Kicking Claw Force\N{\fscx65\fscy65\bord3}Arabasta's Elite Guard Unit
Dialogue: 2,0:02:16.01,0:02:20.14,Captions-207-,,0,0,0,,{\pos(720,751)\fscx75\fscy75\fnDFPGiHi-W7-Strp\b0\bord0\c&HF6F7F6&\4a&HFF&\blur0.9\fad(521,0)}Kicking Claw Force\N{\fscx65\fscy65}Arabasta's Elite Guard Unit
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.15,0:02:24.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't attack, men.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.35,0:02:27.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You'll only be throwing your lives away.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.57,0:02:34.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They broke the door down. Adari, move.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.71,0:02:37.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Please, save His Majesty\Nand Princess Phoebe.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.91,0:02:42.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Your Majesty, defending you to\Nthe death is not only our mission.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.11,0:02:43.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It is the highest honor and privilege.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.07,0:02:46.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Therefore, we can't simply avoid him.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.53,0:02:49.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He is one of the seven\Nwarlords of the sea.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.53,0:02:52.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The only way to beat\Nhim is to fight dirty.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.69,0:02:54.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We four are as one.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.71,0:02:56.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We fight for your honor.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.87,0:02:58.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,To set things right.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.25,0:03:02.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It seems that you have\Nquite the reputation.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.69,0:03:05.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Therefore, I will spare your lives.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.59,0:03:06.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Leave now and go home.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.07,0:03:08.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We can't do that.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.43,0:03:12.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There is another reason\Nwe will not withdraw.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.95,0:03:13.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Reason?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.11,0:03:19.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If the rumors are true and\Nyou really are the ringleader,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.35,0:03:21.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,the architect of this whole rebellion...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.43,0:03:26.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Those bruises.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.83,0:03:30.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What have you men done?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.71,0:03:35.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Shall I?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.07,0:03:38.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You needn't waste your\Ntime on these cretins.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.57,0:03:42.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They didn't.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.03,0:03:48.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Chaka, what's happening to their bodies?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.83,0:03:52.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I fear to temporarily\Nincrease their power.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.73,0:03:55.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They drank the fatal elixir.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.61,0:04:00.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It grants incredible strength,\Nbut then kills the host.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.73,0:04:02.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They're dead men. Oh no!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.65,0:04:08.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You bulked up to challenge\Nme, I'm flattered.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.27,0:04:12.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But what good is victory if\Nyou're not around to enjoy it?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.65,0:04:14.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Chaka, please,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.93,0:04:17.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,forgive us for doing this\Nwithout consulting you,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.53,0:04:22.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but we had to take drastic measures\Nto end this country's suffering.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.27,0:04:45.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,those idiots how could they we
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.53,0:04:49.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,have to make him realize the fury of
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.59,0:04:55.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This country!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.23,0:05:13.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That wasn't the smartest decision.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.97,0:05:17.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A person should value\Nhis life above all else.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.39,0:05:19.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But it's too late for regrets, yes?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.47,0:05:30.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And if you're all going to die anyway, I\Ndon't have to bother killing you myself,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.15,0:05:30.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,right?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.06,0:05:33.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You don't even have the decency to fight!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.77,0:05:51.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Chaka, I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.15,0:06:01.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Behold the very definition of stupidity.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.53,0:06:03.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You bastard!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.65,0:06:13.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Chaka!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.21,0:06:16.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Chaka, this is senseless.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.37,0:06:18.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You'll just be following\Nthem to their deaths.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.93,0:06:21.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ah, they're a zone type.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.41,0:06:38.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I see you share the same flaws\Nthese fools you'll die for others
Dialogue: 1,0:06:45.91,0:06:51.12,Captions-207-,,0,0,0,,{\blur1.2\pos(720,664)\fscx95\fscy95\fnDFPGiHi-W7-Strp\b0\bord4.8\fad(1017,732)\c&H000000&\1a&HFF&\3a&H25&\t(0,1017,\1a&H00&)\t(4478,5210,\1a&HFF&)}Medi Assembly Hall's Front\N{\fscx75\fscy75}Alubarna North Block
Dialogue: 2,0:06:45.91,0:06:51.12,Captions-207-,,0,0,0,,{\blur1\pos(720,664)\fscx95\fscy95\fnDFPGiHi-W7-Strp\b0\bord0\c&HFBFAF9&\fad(1017,732)\4a&HFF&}Medi Assembly Hall's Front\N{\fscx75\fscy75}Alubarna North Block
Dialogue: 3,0:06:45.91,0:06:51.12,Captions-207-,,0,0,0,,{\blur1\pos(720,664)\fscx95\fscy95\fnDFPGiHi-W7-Strp\b0\bord0\c&HFBFAF9&\fad(1017,732)\4a&HFF&}Medi Assembly Hall's Front\N{\fscx75\fscy75}Alubarna North Block
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.87,0:06:53.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Damn it.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.17,0:06:55.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Lost too much, Willett.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.31,0:07:02.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes, I should be thankful the cuts aren't\Nthat deep, but it does hurt like ow.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.89,0:07:06.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wonder how the others are doing.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.15,0:07:09.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Want to know what's going on.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.43,0:07:11.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Idiots better not be dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.07,0:07:12.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.98,0:07:15.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What do you mean I have\Nto pair with eyelash?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.37,0:07:20.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Look, he's a camel!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.21,0:07:24.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm very fragile so I need\Nsomeone who can back me up
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.75,0:07:26.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Man up the raffle was fair.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.67,0:07:30.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You got eyelash and that's that fine But\Nyou better promise me one thing when me
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.67,0:07:32.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and this stupid camel are standing at the
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.19,0:07:35.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,doorway of death Please\Ncome to our rescue. Sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.39,0:07:36.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I only save the damsels.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.03,0:07:38.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're on your own
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.59,0:07:47.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, what's wrong? Usopp?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.87,0:07:49.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why are you crying?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.31,0:07:57.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, you're crying, yeah, he who\Nsmelt the dilled, yeah, that's it,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.87,0:07:58.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,you dilded, you dilded,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.78,0:08:04.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,you dilded, you dilded, you're a dilded, a\Ndilded smelter, that old hag said, Luffy,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.59,0:08:06.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,she said Luffy's dead,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.33,0:08:10.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,so I, I wonder if it's true, come on,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.19,0:08:14.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,you guys really believe that,\Nof course not, Luffy's alive,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.19,0:08:15.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,what do you think we are, stupid,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.59,0:08:18.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,that's right, I don't believe\Nit either, Luffy is alive,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.57,0:08:21.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,yeah, all right, I get it, you're\Npreaching to the choir here?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.53,0:08:23.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What we have to do now is\Nget to the palace ASAP!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.01,0:08:26.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now if you don't mind,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.31,0:08:29.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,try to plug your snot at least until\Nthe rumbling from the battle stops!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.81,0:08:32.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't swallow it!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.67,0:08:37.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thank you everyone!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.71,0:08:39.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're welcome!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.25,0:08:40.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But it's too early to thank us!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.67,0:08:41.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's right!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.58,0:08:44.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Besides, if you really\Nwant to thank pirates you?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.71,0:08:46.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They have to let us see some goods.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.27,0:08:50.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Nami, what is it you're trying to\Nleech out of this country anyway?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.17,0:08:51.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is Nami okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.81,0:08:54.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Did she manage to get away?
Dialogue: 1,0:08:54.49,0:08:58.45,Captions-207-,,0,0,0,,{\pos(720,688)\fscx88\fscy88\fnDFPGiHi-W7-Strp\b0\bord5\c&H050505&\3c&H131921&\blur1.3\fad(982,434)\q2\clip(14,510,769,766)\1a&HFF&\3a&HFF&\t(0,605,\2a&H00&\3a&H05&)\t(0,439,1.3,\clip(14,486,1410,766))\t(0,982,\1a&H00&)\t(3526,3960,\1a&HFF&)}Behind the Medi Assembly Hall\N{\fscx75\fscy75}Alubarna North Block
Dialogue: 2,0:08:54.49,0:08:58.45,Captions-207-,,0,0,0,,{\pos(720,688)\fscx88\fscy88\fnDFPGiHi-W7-Strp\b0\bord0.6\blur1\fad(982,434)\q2\3c&HFBFDF7&\c&HFBFDF7&\clip(14,510,769,766)\t(0,605,\2a&H00&\3a&H00&)\t(0,439,1.3,\clip(14,486,1410,766))\4a&HFF&\1a&HFF&\t(0,982,\1a&H00&)\t(3526,3960,\1a&HFF&)}Behind the Medi Assembly Hall\N{\fscx75\fscy75}Alubarna North Block
Dialogue: 3,0:08:54.49,0:08:58.45,Captions-207-,,0,0,0,,{\pos(720,688)\fscx88\fscy88\fnDFPGiHi-W7-Strp\b0\bord0\c&HFBFDF7&\blur1\fad(982,434)\q2\clip(14,510,769,766)\t(0,605,\2a&H00&\3a&H00&\1a&H00&)\t(0,439,1.3,\clip(14,486,1410,766))\4a&HFF&}Behind the Medi Assembly Hall\N{\fscx75\fscy75}Alubarna North Block
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.07,0:09:02.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They finally came off.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.09,0:09:07.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Calling it a powerful one-shot attack, I\Nthink that's a bit of an understatement.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.89,0:09:10.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The fighting's come far.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.59,0:09:13.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They're right there,\Njust around the corner.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.09,0:09:18.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Guess the situation's changed.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.37,0:09:21.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Anyway, I better get to the palace.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.31,0:09:28.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sounds like the battle's started.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.63,0:09:29.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What about Vivi?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.51,0:09:33.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, yeah. One more thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.43,0:09:35.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And this is an important fact to remember.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.29,0:09:39.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,After a battle, these guys\Nput down a ton of food.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.97,0:09:40.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.27,0:09:43.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We'll be waiting for you!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.83,0:09:49.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is absolutely crucial.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.63,0:09:53.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't screw this up!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.53,0:09:54.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's go!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.93,0:09:56.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,See you at the palace!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.83,0:10:09.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Chaka!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.61,0:10:19.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Weakness is a crime, punishable by death.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.17,0:10:24.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Phoebe!
Dialogue: 1,0:10:31.13,0:10:37.09,Captions-207-,,0,0,0,,{\pos(720,231)\fscx85\fscy85\fnDFPGiHi-W7-Strp\b0\bord5\c&H000000&\alpha&H30&\blur3}Palace Square\N25 Minutes Until the Explosion
Dialogue: 2,0:10:31.13,0:10:37.09,Captions-207-,,0,0,0,,{\pos(720,231)\fscx85\fscy85\fnDFPGiHi-W7-Strp\b0\bord0.6\c&HFCFAFA&\3c&HFCFAFA&\4a&HFF&\blur0.8}Palace Square\N25 Minutes Until the Explosion
Dialogue: 3,0:10:31.13,0:10:37.09,Captions-207-,,0,0,0,,{\pos(720,231)\fscx85\fscy85\fnDFPGiHi-W7-Strp\b0\bord0\c&HFCFAFA&\4a&HFF&\blur2}Palace Square\N25 Minutes Until the Explosion
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.59,0:10:43.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, Koza.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.11,0:10:50.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Koza.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.51,0:10:51.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's you.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.09,0:10:55.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, I see you came through\Nthe shortcut you used to use.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.07,0:10:57.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This can't be.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.35,0:10:58.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What am I seeing here?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.43,0:11:12.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I came in hope of persuading\Nthe royal army, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.31,0:11:22.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Chaka, and the king is about to\Nbe killed by this country's hero.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.85,0:11:24.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't believe my eyes.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.65,0:11:30.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now things are starting\Nto get interesting.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.21,0:11:32.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Here we are in the midst of an epic war,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.63,0:11:35.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and yet the leaders of both\Nsides aren't on the battlefield.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.25,0:11:37.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Fate has placed them\Nsquabbling at my feet.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.65,0:11:40.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A battle to the death\Nbetween two broken titans
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.37,0:11:43.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,bleeding out the last\Nremnants of their power.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.11,0:11:48.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You seem lost and confused.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.43,0:11:50.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't worry, it's a natural reaction.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.23,0:11:51.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let me help you.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.69,0:11:57.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Relax and open your mind, then imagine being\Nfaced with the worst possible scenario.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.81,0:12:04.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Koza, purge your heart of all suspicion!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.31,0:12:13.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Do you love this country?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.55,0:12:24.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is my home.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.01,0:12:26.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Mine as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.61,0:12:30.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Koza, listen.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.97,0:12:35.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Vivi, who was responsible for the\Ndrought ravaging this country? Tell me?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.91,0:12:40.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It was that honor belongs to me!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.89,0:12:43.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Over the past two years\Neach and every malicious
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.79,0:12:46.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,deed you attributed to the\Nking's doing was in fact?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.49,0:12:51.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Perpetrated by my company a trap that\Nsaw you playing right into our hands.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.99,0:12:54.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It was a flawless systematic\Nplot of deception.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.89,0:12:58.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I Must say it was entertaining\Nwatching as the royal
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.69,0:13:02.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,family and its mighty army\Ndesperately chased our shadows
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.99,0:13:07.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Pity.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.90,0:13:12.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You probably would have died in ignorant\Nbliss not knowing these brutal facts.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.59,0:13:19.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Koza, listen!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.91,0:13:22.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Majesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.23,0:13:25.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's still some time\Nif you have the courage.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.91,0:13:27.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You must act now.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.55,0:13:29.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Save as many citizens as you can.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.27,0:13:35.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,In less than half an hour, the whole palace\Nsquare will be blown to kingdom come.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.43,0:13:37.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What do you mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.85,0:13:39.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So you're still alive, are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.43,0:13:46.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hurry!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.19,0:14:00.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Stop!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.69,0:14:03.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Vivi!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.19,0:14:05.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Get off of me!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.35,0:14:06.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.26,0:14:07.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's no time!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.18,0:14:08.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The battle is about to\Nspill into the square.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.81,0:14:11.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If it's really set to blow up, get off!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.99,0:14:13.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You have to listen to me!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.75,0:14:18.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Think this through, please!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.89,0:14:22.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What will happen if you tell the\Narmies the square is set to explode?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.29,0:14:23.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The men will panic!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.63,0:14:25.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It would only add more\Nchaos to the battle,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.75,0:14:29.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and even if you stop the bomb,\Nit won't stop the fighting!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.33,0:14:32.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Either way, people are still going to die!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.97,0:14:34.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You won't save anyone!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.43,0:14:39.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Understand?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.43,0:14:41.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.34,0:14:43.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, well, what a perceptive girl.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.33,0:14:48.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Our only hope is to do what should\Nhave been done from the start.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.95,0:14:53.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We have to stop the rebellion\Nand end this bloodshed!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.49,0:14:55.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And you...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.45,0:14:58.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're the only one who can do it!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.93,0:15:20.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Did you really think I\Nwas going to sit back and
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.43,0:15:23.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,watch passively while you\Ntried to ruin my plans?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.57,0:15:35.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Chaka!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.11,0:15:41.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I am Alabaster's guardian deity.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.21,0:15:44.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I am the Jackal.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.15,0:15:50.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll fight as long as there\Nis breath left in my body.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.45,0:15:53.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Some call that brave, I call it stupid.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.63,0:15:56.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Do what you must, both of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.37,0:15:59.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I will hold him back\Nfor a few more minutes.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.43,0:16:07.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Chaka, such a shame the leader\Nof the Sanji clan is so weak.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.07,0:16:13.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Boy, what's the matter?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.77,0:16:22.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's wrong with you?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.89,0:16:23.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm a child.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.80,0:16:24.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You can't treat me like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.91,0:16:26.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're a pain in the neck, kid.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.21,0:16:32.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Koza, you asked me to train you,\Nor have you forgotten that already?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.59,0:16:48.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Report from Guard Unit 2 to Headquarters!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.01,0:16:51.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Report from Unit 2 to Headquarters!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.81,0:16:53.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Line four has been breached!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.81,0:16:55.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Enemy has broken through!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.69,0:16:57.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The rebel army is\Ncurrently passing through
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.87,0:17:00.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,the central plaza heading\Nto the north block!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.15,0:17:01.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They will reach the palace!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.57,0:17:04.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Raise the flag to surrender!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.25,0:17:08.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Royal army, you will\Nsurrender immediately!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.33,0:17:12.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Princess of Alabasta,\Nis she serious? But why?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.59,0:17:13.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's absurd.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.75,0:17:17.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If we do as she says, that would\Nmean the end of this country.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.49,0:17:18.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, look! That's...!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.99,0:17:21.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's Koza!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.47,0:17:24.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What is the rebel army's leader\Ndoing here in the palace?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.53,0:17:26.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hear me, the princess speaks the truth!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.35,0:17:31.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We no longer desire victory,\Nonly to end this conflict!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.45,0:17:33.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Both sides have spilled enough blood!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.77,0:17:43.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I will make each and every rebel understand\Nthe pointlessness of this civil war!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.05,0:17:48.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They will see, as I do, that we\Nno longer have reason to fight!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.77,0:17:51.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,In the interest of restoring\Npeace and preserving life,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.93,0:17:54.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I ask you, wave the white flag! Please!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.23,0:17:58.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The king's head will roll this day!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.31,0:18:02.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, I can see the clock tower up ahead!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.49,0:18:10.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're approaching the palace square!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.73,0:18:13.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Prepare to attack!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.33,0:18:24.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wait! Stop!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.79,0:18:34.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,White flags?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.43,0:18:36.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The royal army is waving white flags!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.31,0:18:38.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We did it!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.67,0:18:39.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They surrender!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.49,0:18:44.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's Koza!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.13,0:18:47.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The battle is over!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.71,0:18:52.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sir, everyone, quiet your\Nanger and lower your weapons.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.29,0:18:55.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The royal army will stand down.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.81,0:18:57.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let no more blood stain the streets.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.23,0:19:02.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Please, listen to him.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.39,0:19:21.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is this the truth, Koza?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.97,0:19:22.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.03,0:19:24.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The battle's finally over.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.17,0:19:43.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Cousin!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.87,0:19:47.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Cousin!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.57,0:19:52.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Cousin!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.93,0:19:55.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You just wait until it's finished.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.27,0:19:59.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This town will bring good fortune\Nand joy to so many people.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.33,0:20:02.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's going to be the best town ever.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.37,0:20:06.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,When it's up and running, I'll\Npersonally give you the grand tour.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.43,0:20:14.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't fight the Rebel Army.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.35,0:20:19.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't fight them.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.99,0:20:29.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How can they shoot Koza? Get them!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.31,0:20:36.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's the Baroque Works!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.57,0:20:46.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What did you do?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.91,0:20:47.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why did you shoot?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.13,0:20:58.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Listen to me now, Rebel Army.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.33,0:20:59.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Do not fight.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.13,0:21:04.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.39,0:21:06.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Where'd the sandstorm come from?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.99,0:21:08.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Listen, Rebel Army.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.03,0:21:14.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They're shooting at us.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.79,0:21:15.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How dare they?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.15,0:21:26.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Where did all the sand\Ncome from so suddenly?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.93,0:21:28.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We can't see anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:33.99,0:21:35.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Damn it! Bastards!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:40.95,0:21:42.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't shoot carelessly!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.53,0:21:43.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's going on?!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.03,0:21:46.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They still don't know what's happening.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.41,0:21:47.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's going on, you idiots,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:47.67,0:21:51.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,is that Baroque Works members are\Nposing as soldiers in both your armies.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:57.03,0:21:57.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Stop now!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:58.43,0:22:00.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come on, just hang in there!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:08.09,0:22:09.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They aren't surrendering.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:10.77,0:22:14.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thought they'd ambush us by\Nraising a phony white flag, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:14.61,0:22:17.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So this is how the\NRoyal Army plans to win.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:17.87,0:22:19.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,By using dirty tricks like that!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:25.57,0:22:26.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Stop it!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:27.01,0:22:28.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, don't do this!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:28.65,0:22:30.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Please, stop fighting!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:30.51,0:22:31.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Soldiers!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:31.73,0:22:32.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Look up here!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:35.73,0:22:38.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Stop, Rebel Army.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:38.75,0:22:40.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Stop this.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:40.35,0:22:41.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This battle is...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:56.07,0:22:58.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, are you okay? Damn.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:59.29,0:23:01.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now, Royal Army, launch counter-attack!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:34.17,0:23:35.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Stop it!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:35.27,0:23:36.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Stop fighting!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:39.35,0:23:40.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Please don't fight.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:42.63,0:23:43.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Stop now!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:44.51,0:23:47.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You fought long and hard,\Nprincess, and did well.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:48.27,0:23:50.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But now...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:50.45,0:23:51.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Give up.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:52.15,0:23:56.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Your voice will no longer\Nreach them. So this is it.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:02.01,0:24:06.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You have to run away vv get away\Nfrom him before it's too late!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:14.93,0:24:16.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I won't.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:21.37,0:24:23.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You made this dust, devil.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:23.49,0:24:25.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's your doing, isn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:27.35,0:24:30.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But still, there's time.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:31.87,0:24:34.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If I stop the explosion that's\Nscheduled in 15 minutes,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:34.93,0:24:37.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can still reduce the\Nnumber of casualties.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:42.23,0:24:44.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If I try this, the rebellion will stop.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:44.73,0:24:47.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If I try that, the rebellion will stop.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:48.55,0:24:50.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's time to wake up, princess.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:51.85,0:24:54.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm tired of your useless idealism.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:54.47,0:24:55.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's gotten pathetic.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:58.83,0:25:03.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What good are your happy ideals if you\Ncan't do anything to make them reality?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:03.13,0:25:05.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Then they're nothing but dreams.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:05.55,0:25:08.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And your dreams don't stand a chance.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:11.19,0:25:13.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't care what you think of my ideals.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:14.73,0:25:16.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm never going to give up on them!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:20.29,0:25:21.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You would never understand!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:22.69,0:25:25.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm this country's\Nprincess, I won't give up!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:25.51,0:25:27.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I won't give in no matter what!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:32.79,0:25:34.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You really are a sad little girl.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:36.93,0:25:38.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I refuse...
Dialogue: 0,0:25:39.19,0:25:40.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,to give up!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:43.15,0:25:46.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I will save Alamaster!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:48.13,0:25:48.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Alamaster!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:53.61,0:25:54.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,VV!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:58.83,0:26:02.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You have only fifteen minutes\Nuntil the square is blown up.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:03.89,0:26:07.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,More of the rebel forces are\Ngathering as reinforcements arrive.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:09.53,0:26:14.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,One after another, without even realizing\Nthey're marching to their death.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:25.01,0:26:29.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You know, you could have let the Royal Army\Nknow about the coming explosion earlier.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:29.81,0:26:32.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If so, maybe there\Nwould have been a panic.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:32.35,0:26:36.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But then you could have saved tens\Nof thousands of innocent lives.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:37.49,0:26:38.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Stop it!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:39.03,0:26:40.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Please, crocodile!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:40.63,0:26:41.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just let her go!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:45.87,0:26:50.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,In the end, your plans for saving this\Ncountry have done more harm than good.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:50.81,0:26:53.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Your wretched failures\Nhave only ended up hurting
Dialogue: 0,0:26:53.69,0:26:56.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,the precious citizens\Nwho you love so dearly.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:02.43,0:27:04.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,From the beginning of my operations here,
Dialogue: 0,0:27:05.07,0:27:08.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,the sheer stupidity of\Nyour country has amused me.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:09.79,0:27:12.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So pathetic, so easy to manipulate!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:18.99,0:27:23.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You did a decent job of spying on\Nour company for the past two years,
Dialogue: 0,0:27:23.81,0:27:25.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I will grant you that much?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:26.57,0:27:28.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's me, Vivi.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:28.33,0:27:29.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't you recognize me?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:31.39,0:27:32.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I look different.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:32.79,0:27:34.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I lost some weight, I suppose.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:36.17,0:27:40.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But when it was all said and done, you\Nreally had no hope of changing anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:41.87,0:27:43.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Stopping the rebellion.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:43.57,0:27:44.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Saving the kingdom.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:45.59,0:27:49.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All those worthless ideas\Nyou've clung to for so long.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:49.61,0:27:53.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,In the end, they just\Ncreated more victims for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:54.81,0:27:56.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let me tell you something.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:58.47,0:28:00.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're never going to save this country!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:03.81,0:28:05.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Goodbye, princess.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:31.95,0:28:34.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ah ha ha ha ha...
Dialogue: 0,0:28:49.95,0:28:51.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It can't be.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:53.59,0:28:54.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Crocodile!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:00.29,0:29:01.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Luffy!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:04.05,0:29:06.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It can't be!

